
Experiment Test Data
====================

A number of ways of specifying experiments.


experiment_1.json
-----------------

A list of experiments in a single file. The experiment list is at the top of the
file and refers to a load of models later in the file by index.


experiment_2.json
-----------------

A list of experiments which referencing models in separate files by filename.
The models are loaded from the imageset.

Uses: 
  - imageset.json
  - crystal.json


experiment_3.json
-----------------

A list of experiments which reference models in separate files by filename. All
the models are specified by file.

Uses:
  - imageset.json
  - beam.json
  - detector.json
  - goniometer.json
  - scan.json
  - crystal.json


experiment_4.json
-----------------

A list of experiments which reference models in the same file and externally.

Uses:
  - crystal.json
  - beam.json

